    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start, please register your participation for the event."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If there is no fee, you should proceed to register a post-seminar request. However, if there is a fee, you need to create a purchase request."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "proceed to register a post-seminar request"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "create a purchase request"
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "Next, you should check if the purchase request has been approved."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "If it is approved, you will receive an approved notification."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "On the other hand, if the purchase request is rejected, you will be notified of the rejection."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "If you receive an approved notification, you should then register a post-seminar request."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "If you receive a rejection notification, the process will come to an end."
